  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Bone-in turkey breast takes center stage with golden, herb kissed skin and irresistibly juicy meat. Marinated in bright lemon and apple cider, each slice stays tender while soaking up the flavors of garlic, rosemary, and thyme. As it roasts, the kitchen fills with a comforting aroma that naturally draws everyone in. Simple to prepare with just salt, pepper, and a splash of savory broth, this oven roasted favorite delivers warmth, ease, and satisfying flavor in every bite.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-bone-turkey-breast\">Why You’ll Love This bone turkey breast</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-bone-turkey-breast\">How to Make bone turkey breast</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-bone-turkey-breast\">Pro Tips for Making bone turkey breast</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-bone-turkey-breast\">How to Serve this bone turkey breast</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-bone-turkey-breast\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This bone turkey breast</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Perfectly juicy and tender every time.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Packed with rich, savory flavors that delight the palate.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Simple to prepare, making it ideal for busy weeknights.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile for sandwiches, salads, or as a main dish.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Healthy option that’s low in fat and high in protein.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-10643\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"10643\" data-servings=\"8\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe